-toned wainscoting and a neat dark grey wool carpet. The furniture is elegant and refined but lacks the warmth of daily life. Against the wall is a solid wood long desk with a dark leather chair. On the desk is a minimalist retro table lamp emitting soft cool white light, alongside an exquisite bone china tea set. On one side is a clean, spacious black louvered floor-to-ceiling window with half-drawn curtains, outside of which fine autumn rain falls on plant leaves. The overall lighting is dominated by indoor cool white diffuse light, bright and transparent yet conveying a sense of cold isolation and the distance of a deep estate.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video depicts Lu Tingxue (<Subject 1>) in the manor side courtyard interior (<Subject 2>) resolutely flipping over the equity agreement on the desk to protect her mother's trust, speaking defiantly to the retreating family members. The visual style is realistic 3D with an aesthetic and dramatic tone, utilizing cool white lighting to emphasize the chilly atmosphere of the rainy night.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - Lu Tingxue's identity, wavy dark brown hair, fair skin, and elegant light pink-white pajama set from <Picture 1> are fully retained, though her expression shifts to an intensely cold, tense, and defiant state to match the dramatic action.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - The side courtyard interior from <Picture 2> is fully retained, including the cool grey wainscoting, dark grey carpet, solid wood desk, dark leather chair, retro table lamp, bone china tea set, and louvered windows with rainy night lighting.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video features a realistic 3D aesthetic with a beautiful, refined, and subtly dramatic visual style, characterized by cool, white, chilly lighting on a rainy night that heightens the tension of the confrontation.\n[Shot 1] In a close-up shot with a slight camera shake, Lu Tingxue (<Subject 1>), with her wavy dark brown hair, fair skin, and elegant light pink-white printed pajamas, stands tall like a pine opposite the solid wood desk in the side courtyard interior (<Subject 2>). Her eyes reveal a bone-chilling coldness. Her right hand suddenly rises up and fiercely slaps the transfer agreement on the desk, flipping the white papers into the air. Lu Tingxue (S1) shouts angrily, <d>[Chinese] 滚！</d>.\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, the shot cuts to a wide shot with a slow truck right. The white pages of the agreement rustle and scatter through the air, falling onto the dark grey carpet. The overturned bone china teacup on the desk spills a shallow pool of tea. Lu Tingxue (<Subject 1>) steps through the scattered papers, standing tall and unyielding, her gaze locked on the two retreating figures. She says in a cold, sharp voice, <d>[Chinese] 陆振海当年暗中侵吞我母亲遗留的千亿资产，对外打着让我静养的幌子，切断我的通讯，不就是想逼我交出母亲留下的信托私章？</d>.\n[Shot 3] At 00:08.000, the shot cuts to a close-up with a slight physical push in. The camera faces Lu Tingxue (<Subject 1>) directly, focusing on her tense face and reddened eyes. Her gaze is icy and fierce. She declares word by word with absolute resolve, <d>[Chinese] 只要我陆听雪还有一口气在，你们休想得逞！</d>.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe overall soundscape is dominated by the dramatic physical sound effects of the scene: the violent whoosh of the agreement papers being flipped over, the crisp rustling of the white papers scattering onto the dark grey carpet, and the delicate, weak clinking of the bone china teacup tipping over on the wooden desk. A subtle, chilly indoor room tone persists in the background, consistent with the rainy night atmosphere.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 39